nb-tts-normalizer
Copyright 2026 National Library of Norway

Developed under the Språkmodeller team with implementation assistance from
OpenAI Codex.

NbAiLab's Norwegian Wav2Vec2 normalization scripts and the
peresolb/number-conversion project informed the initial investigation.
The arithmetic verbalizer and span engine in this repository are new
implementations; the upstream converter is not bundled.

Språkrådet's language guidance informed reading conventions. The optional
VoxCPM adapter targets the interface supplied by OpenBMB's VoxCPM project.
See README.md and SOURCES.md for acknowledgements and source references.
